      "content": "It cut off there. could you finish that scenario? also i'm specifically worried about the offshore accounts. sometimes those things feel like they are just hidden away or tucked into corners where you can't see them easily, so where exactly does the UK government get their authority to tax money that isn't even in a UK bank?",
